-- Pipes from both ends, leaving a slot through the middle.
--
-- The piece that makes the course a course. With only a high pipe and a low one
-- the clear bands are wide and half the screen is always safe; this one's slot
-- is five rows, so a stretch of it has to be flown down the middle rather than
-- along the top or the bottom.

tile #  pipe   solid  pipe.svg
tile _  ground solid  ground.svg
tile o  cloud         cloud.svg
tile .  sky           sky.svg

